      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary There are no data on the presence of norepinephrine in either human or animal milk, the effects on the breastfed infant, or the effects on milk production.",
